769
00:35:07.150 --> 00:35:11.810
So, first of all, I just want you guys to know that Greg spoke with us about this.

770
00:35:11.930 --> 00:35:17.930
He said that he really wanted Jim's proposal to Pam to be in the season premiere.

771
00:35:17.930 --> 00:35:20.830
