773
00:35:24.290 --> 00:35:26.430
So, he thought this would be a real shock.

774
00:35:26.630 --> 00:35:27.410
And it was.

775
00:35:27.570 --> 00:35:32.190
Jenna, I even remember at the table read, you know, we had so much going on with this weight

776
00:35:32.190 --> 00:35:35.250
