freeway between Scranton and New York in the rain, and they based the rest stop on one that

785
00:36:05.110 --> 00:36:08.950
Greg Daniels had traveled to as a kid along the Merritt Parkway.

786
00:36:09.110 --> 00:36:11.830
We did not actually fly to this location.

787
00:36:12.130 --> 00:36:14.090
This is the insane part.

788
00:36:14.290 --> 00:36:21.310
They built this in the parking lot of a Best Buy that I have been to many times, actually.

789
00:36:22.270 --> 00:36:28.630
What they did was they used Google Street View to capture images of a

790
00:36:28.630 --> 00:36:34.530
real gas station along the Merritt Parkway, and then using those images, they built it

791
00:36:34.530 --> 00:36:36.370
