00:36:36.570 --> 00:36:39.710
It took them about nine days to build it.

793
00:36:39.830 --> 00:36:47.910
To create the illusion of highway traffic, they built a four-lane circular racetrack around

794
00:36:47.910 --> 00:36:49.570
the gas station set.

795
00:36:49.570 --> 00:36:58.330
They set up cameras on the other side of this raceway, and they had cars drive around it at 55

796
00:36:58.330 --> 00:36:59.030
miles an hour.

797
00:36:59.350 --> 00:37:03.850
Then they added rain pouring down on us, these giant rain machines.

798
00:37:04.650 --> 00:37:09.790
Our production manager, Randy Cordray, said they had about 35 precision drivers.

799
00:37:09.790 --> 00:37:12.590
They were driving not just cars, but like semi-trucks.

800
00:37:12.590 --> 00:37:19.050
When we were standing there on that set, you could feel the wind of these cars speeding

801
00:37:19.050 --> 00:37:19.830
