00:37:46.290 --> 00:37:50.730
It lasts 52 seconds, and it costs $250,000.

809
00:37:51.170 --> 00:37:52.750
Oh, my Lord.

810
00:37:53.710 --> 00:37:55.290
Oh, my Lord.

811
00:37:56.370 --> 00:37:57.010
Wow.

812
00:37:57.770 --> 00:37:58.010
Yeah.

813
00:37:58.270 --> 00:38:02.290
So a quarter of a million dollars for less than one minute of screen time.

814
00:38:02.450 --> 00:38:03.590
Oh, my gosh.

