So acres and acres of paved ground, which is what they needed if they were going to build

822
00:38:33.550 --> 00:38:35.250
a racetrack, basically, right?

823
00:38:35.410 --> 00:38:35.650
Yeah.

824
00:38:35.890 --> 00:38:37.490
So these cars could loop around.

825
00:38:38.170 --> 00:38:43.590
Now, according to Randy Cordray, the reason why it was such a massive, massive, massive

